{
  "text": " And the first point I want to make is for new biologic products, we always demand safety, safety, safety. There are safety standards for the roof over your head right now. There's safety standards for the clothes that you're wearing, for the cars that you're driving, safety standards. Here we are today, embarked on the biggest mass public health vaccination program in the history of the world, and we haven't seen a single standard applied for safety. So what we have is we have a situation where we needed a report card once a month. We have three products, Pfizer, Moderna, and J&J. They are extremely unlikely to be the same. In fact, I tell you they're not the same. Moderna's 100 micrograms, Pfizer's 30 micrograms per shot. Johnson & Johnson is adenoviral particle numbers given. They are not the same. So any person or any group that says, here just take a vaccine, any vaccine, you should be asking yourself, wait a minute, there's three products. Don't I get to choose? Doesn't it matter which one's better? Doesn't it matter which one's safer? How come nobody's asking that question? Where has been the monthly press briefings from our stakeholders? Now the CDC and FDA are running the program. They work for us. We don't work for them. They owed us a monthly press briefing and a monthly comprehensive safety and efficacy report. They have all the data. They have all the data. I recognize lots of you took the vaccine. You signed consent to have your data go to the central center. They know it all, but we have not had a single report card. Nothing. Nothing. We're nearly a year into the program and all we've been told is take a vaccine, any vaccine, no report on safety and efficacy. We have more safety reports on building inspections, on inspections of apartments. You have more safety reports on your car inspection. And here we are taking an injection of a novel biologic agent that is supposed to be linked to our freedoms and absolutely no safety reports.",
